o-rate basis,and from the second month will be deducted on the 1st of each month.\nPlan includes\n700GB\nLocal Data\nFree Local Data Roll Over for up to 1 billing cycle month. Maximum of\n1400GB\nper month\n50GB\nRoaming Data in Mainland China\n400GB\nRoaming Data in MIT\nShow more\nApply for a China Number\nAdd-on at $5.1/mo for the \"1 Card 2 Numbers\" service. Easily get an extra China number, or host your existing Mainland China Unicom number.Plans that do not include a free Mainland China number require 1 month of active subscription before application.\nGet Started\n5G\nFree China number\n800\nGB\nSG\n|\nMY\n|\nID\n|\nCN\n|\nAPAC\n$\n24.9\n/Month\nThe first month is charged on a pro-rate basis,and from the second month will be deducted on the 1st of each month.\nPlan includes\n800GB\nLocal Data\nFree Local Data Roll Over for up to 1 billing cycle month. Maximum of\n1600GB\nper month\n80GB\nRoaming Data in Mainland China\n500GB\nRoaming Data in MIT\nShow more\nApply for a China Number\nFree 12-month \"1 Card 2 Numbers\" service. Easily get an extra China number, or host your existing Mainland China Unicom number.\nGet Started\n5G\nFree China number\n1000\nGB\nSG\n|\nMY\n|\nID\n|\nCN\n|\nAPAC\n$\n29.9\n/Month\nThe first month is charged on a pro-rate basis,and from the second month will be deducted on the 1st of each month.\nPlan includes\n1000GB\nLocal Data\nFree Local Data Roll Over for up to 1 billing cycle month. Maximum of\n2000GB\nper month\n100GB\nRoaming Data in Mainland China\n600GB\nRoaming Data in MIT\nShow more\nApply for a China Number\nFree 12-month \"1 Card 2 Numbers\" service. Easily get an extra China number, or host your existing Mainland China Unicom number.\nGet Started\nOne SIM, Two Numbers\nStay connected in both Singapore and China with a single SIM card\nConvenient and Affordable\nNo waiting required—activate as soon as you have a CUniq number. Apply online.\nFlexible Options\nBond an existing Unicom Mainland number or apply for a new Chi